VictoryRoadLair_2F_Text_SeleneIntro::
    .string "SELENE: The HALL of STONES. Seven\n"
    .string "gather here, three are missing.\p"
    .string "APATITE, TOPAZ, OPAL. You hold\n"
    .string "one. The boy in red carried the\p"
    .string "other. The MASTER will have\n"
    .string "them all. Over my dead body? No.\p"
    .string "Over yours.$"

VictoryRoadLair_2F_Text_SeleneDefeat::
    .string "…Fine. Go and see for yourself.$"

VictoryRoadLair_2F_Text_SelenePost::
    .string "SELENE: Go up. The THRONE ROOM\n"
    .string "is beyond that door.\p"
    .string "Whatever you find, remember: we\n"
    .string "only wanted the POKéMON free.$"

VictoryRoadLair_2F_Text_StoneGrenat::
    .string "The GRENAT STONE rests\n"
    .string "on a black pedestal.\p"
    .string "It was taken from its town.\n"
    .string "It pulses, as if it wanted home.$"

